{"ref":"BDB, רֳאִי","hw":"רֳאִי","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רֳאִי</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>looking, seeing, sight</strong>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>seeing</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵל ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:13\" href=\"/Genesis.16.13\">Gn 16:13a</a> <em>a God of seeing</em> (= who sees).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>appearance</em> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">מַרְאֶה</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">טוֹב רֹ֑אִי</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 16:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.16.12\">1 S 16:12</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מֵרֹ֑אִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 33:21\" href=\"/Job.33.21\">Jb 33:21</a> <em>without</em> (healthy, fair) <em>appearance</em>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>sight</em>, (warning-) <em>spectacle</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּרֹ֑אִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Nahum 3:6\" href=\"/Nahum.3.6\">Na 3:6</a>.—<span dir=\"rtl\">ר׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 16:13\" href=\"/Genesis.16.13\">Gn 16:13b</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 7:8\" href=\"/Job.7.8\">Jb 7:8</a> is <strong>Qal</strong> Pt. sf.","next":"BDB, ראית","prev":"BDB, רְאִי"}